vestment is nil (capex and working capital no more than cover depreciation), so fundamental growth is near zero.","Free cash flow has compounded 33.1% a year over five years.","Forward indicators: deferred revenue up 39%.","Capex runs 7.6x depreciation (1.6% of sales), so it is building capacity for future growth."],"own":["Insiders own 18.0%, meaningful skin in the game, and institutions hold 44%.","Shareholder yield is a modest 1.7% (1.7% in dividends).","It has paid a dividend for 12 consecutive years, though it has been cut 4.6% a year over the last five."],"people":["With about 139 employees, each generates about $3.6M of revenue, 3.5x the Utilities median, and productivity has risen 6.2% a year.","CEO pay is $1.4M (0x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores poorly (8/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $18K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":72,"head":"Avoid: priced 20% above its fair value of $14.74.","pros":["Model rating LEAN BUY (composite 52, gates 13/25)","ROIC 31.4% vs WACC 7.0%","Net cash of $203.6M","Piotroski F-score 7/9","P/E 14.3x vs sector 20.4x"],"cons":["Trades 20% above fair value of $14.74","1 analysts' mean target $16.00 (-10%)"],"flags":["Priced 20% above its fair value of $14.74"],"need":[],"buy_below":12.53,"vc":{"base":14.74,"base_src":"blend","bear":null,"bull":null,"alt_median":14.74,"n_alt":3,"gap":null,"dispersion":0.4606,"level":"LOW","why":["models disagree (46% dispersion)"]},"med":{"pe":20.4014,"ev_ebitda":12.539,"pfcf":19.6541,"pb":1.8576,"roic":0.0568,"gross_margin":0.3591,"fcf_margin":-0.0633,"div_yield":0.0329}},"ticker":"GNE","date":"2026-11-06"}